   2  0000              ; Microsoft SoftCard CP/M 2.20 (44K) -- CCP (Console Command Processor)
   3  0000              ; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   4  0000              ; Runtime-addressed (de-skewed): ORG $9400 (CBASE), runs $9400-$9BFF. An independent
   5  0000              ; compilation; calls the BDOS only through the $0005 ABI and references the BDOS base
   6  0000              ; once (BDOS_FBASE). The 44K system tracks store this sector-interleaved; the disk
   7  0000              ; producer re-applies the skew (cpm_pipeline/deskew.py). See ../../docs/CPM_Skew_Findings.md.
   8  0000              ; ============================================================================
